<title>SWITZERLAND: OZ sets put CHF wts on CSG.</title>
<headline>OZ sets put CHF wts on CSG.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>warrant details follow:</p>
<p>WARRANT ISSUER: OZ Holding</p>
<p>PUT WTS ON Credit Suisse Group registered shares</p>
<p>NUMBER OF WTS 5,000,000</p>
<p> ASSETS/WT   1/5			  WT PRICE*   4.40 CHF</p>
<p> ASSET PRICE*    192.00 CHF	   EXERCISE PRICE  185.00 CHF</p>
<p> EXER DATE  JUL1798+		    EXERCISE LOT   FIVE</p>
<p> *AT WT ISSUE (Valor 698 280)	 PAY DATE/LIST  AUG29/SWISS</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
